# With Aang, at the Crossroads's leave trigger on the stack, Bot1's Mirrorweave makes Aang a copy of Memnite until end of
# turn; the delayed "Transform Aang" the trigger creates is still Aang's (CR 603.7, 707.2), so at Bot1's next upkeep, with
# Mirrorweave over, Aang transforms.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Aang, at the Crossroads
Ornithopter
Mirrorweave
Memnite
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
